haven't even noticed.

250
00:16:54,993 --> 00:16:56,453
Try paying attention.

251
00:16:58,313 --> 00:17:01,190
Come to think of it, I
guess I did smell gasoline.

252
00:17:01,273 --> 00:17:02,449
